Source: https://github.com/qoretechnologies/module-treesitter
Comment: Grammar orig components retain only source, grammar definitions, queries,
 licenses and associated manifests. Unused bindings, fixtures and artwork are omitted.
 Exact URLs, checksums and retained paths are in debian/vendor-sources.json.
 .
 The binary also incorporates the Qore grammar from libqore-dev (copyright 2026
 Qore Technologies, s.r.o.). Its grammar is LGPL-2.1, with its scanner under
 LGPL-2.1-or-later. Built-Using records the matching Qore source package version.
 On Debian systems the LGPL 2.1 text is in /usr/share/common-licenses/LGPL-2.1.

